# Files that must never be uploaded to GitHub.
# Your tracker data lives inside the phone/browser (IndexedDB), never in this folder,
# but exported files might be saved here by accident. These rules keep them off GitHub.

# Backups and exports (CORE-7 backup, MON-6 CSV, TSK-4 calendar files)
*backup*
!core/backup.js
*.backup
backups/
exports/
*.csv
*.ics
*.xlsx
*-export*.json
lifetracker*.json

# Secrets and personal settings
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
.claude/settings.local.json

# Computer clutter and logs
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log
*.tmp
~$*
